   "name": "places/ChIJcexy63d1lR4REWSGDeTRsxU/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SUGQxVTViMFZ6YTJwVUxWWnBaMGt6VlhkMFVFRRAB",
   "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 months ago",
   "rating": 5,
   "text": {
    "text": "I’ve been cutting my hair here for years and have no complaints. The barbers are highly skilled. The facials are really great. All the staff are friendly. You’re treated like royalty from the moment you arrive until the moment you leave.\n\nThe only thing that sometimes disappoints me is how staff here come and go. Just as you get used to a 1 barber cutting your hair, they leave. I was very disappointed when I found out that Ruhill no longer works here. He was excellent & always in high demand! If you’re one of those people who prefers the same barber for years, this is not the place for you. Having said that, every time a new guy cut my hair, I was never disappointed (personally)\n\nIt’s a little on the pricey side, but well worth it.\nWhether a smooth high top fade, a trim, or a hot towel shave with a blade, I always left satisfied. As the saying goes: “YOU GET WHAT YOU PAY FOR”.\n\n#HighlyRecommend",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
   "originalText": {
    "text": "I’ve been cutting my hair here for years and have no complaints. The barbers are highly skilled. The facials are really great. All the staff are friendly. You’re treated like royalty from the moment you arrive until the moment you leave.\n\nThe only thing that sometimes disappoints me is how staff here come and go. Just as you get used to a 1 barber cutting your hair, they leave. I was very disappointed when I found out that Ruhill no longer works here. He was excellent & always in high demand! If you’re one of those people who prefers the same barber for years, this is not the place for you. Having said that, every time a new guy cut my hair, I was never disappointed (personally)\n\nIt’s a little on the pricey side, but well worth it.\nWhether a smooth high top fade, a trim, or a hot towel shave with a blade, I always left satisfied. As the saying goes: “YOU GET WHAT YOU PAY FOR”.\n\n#HighlyRecommend",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
