  {
   "name": "places/ChIJcexy63d1lR4REWSGDeTRsxU/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsRVFsTllXREJ4WkZCUE1YUk1ZazFtVVZaWWFuYxAB",
   "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 months ago",
   "rating": 5,
   "text": {
    "text": "A business is only as good as the people behind it, and Moroccan Barber truly has an exceptional team. The employees are what keep any business going by delivering a top-class experience every single time, and this team deserves to be appreciated and looked after for the outstanding work they do.\n\nFrom the barbers to the cleaners, everyone contributes to creating a welcoming, professional, and consistently fresh environment. The fades are always clean, sharp, and on point, and the shop itself is always looking fresh.\n\nBig shoutout to Head Barber Roheel, as well as barbers Angelo, Dillon, Michael, and Quade for their skill and professionalism. Also appreciation to Jennica at reception, Keletso in VIP services, and Mbali in the kitchen for making every visit feel premium from start to finish.\n\nThank you all for the top-tier service and consistently great experience. Highly recommended!⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
   "originalText": {
    "text": "A business is only as good as the people behind it, and Moroccan Barber truly has an exceptional team. The employees are what keep any business going by delivering a top-class experience every single time, and this team deserves to be appreciated and looked after for the outstanding work they do.\n\nFrom the barbers to the cleaners, everyone contributes to creating a welcoming, professional, and consistently fresh environment. The fades are always clean, sharp, and on point, and the shop itself is always looking fresh.\n\nBig shoutout to Head Barber Roheel, as well as barbers Angelo, Dillon, Michael, and Quade for their skill and professionalism. Also appreciation to Jennica at reception, Keletso in VIP services, and Mbali in the kitchen for making every visit feel premium from start to finish.\n\nThank you all for the top-tier service and consistently great experience. Highly recommended!⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
